---
/**
 * StackDiagram — 4-layer DX stack (Epic G).
 * Accessible inline SVG: dotfiles → machine provisioning → LLM policy → tooling → harness.
 * Uses existing tokens via CSS variables (src/styles/tokens.css) and workstation theme.
 * Role img with title/desc for a11y. No external assets.
 */
---

<section aria-labelledby="stack-title" class="ws-stack">
  <div class="ws-stack__head">
    <h2 id="stack-title" class="ws-stack__title">The 4-layer DX stack</h2>
    <p class="ws-stack__lead">
      Four layers, one continuous system: <strong>dotfiles</strong> paint the desktop, <strong
        >machine provisioning</strong
      > boots the host,
      <strong>LLM policy</strong> gates the model, <strong>tooling</strong> delivers every capability. Delegation only — no
      duplication.
    </p>
  </div>

  <figure class="ws-stack__figure" aria-labelledby="ws-stack-svg-title ws-stack-svg-desc">
    <svg
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      viewBox="0 0 860 520"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="ws-stack-svg-title ws-stack-svg-desc"
      class="ws-stack__svg"
    >
      <title id="ws-stack-svg-title">Agentic Workstation — 4-layer DX stack</title>
      <desc id="ws-stack-svg-desc"
        >Dotfiles layer provides HorneroConfig desktop. Machine provisioning layer uses chezmoi to install packages and
        shell. LLM policy layer enforces provider allowlist via env.d. Tooling layer distributes 52 skills and 16 agents
        via agent-toolkit. Harness runtime consumes all layers.</desc
      >
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="ws-stack-bg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#020617"></stop>
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#0F172A"></stop>
        </linearGradient>
        <linearGradient id="ws-stack-accent" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#22D3EE"></stop>
          <stop offset="0.5" stop-color="#A78BFA"></stop>
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#84CC16"></stop>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>

      <rect width="860" height="520" rx="20" fill="url(#ws-stack-bg)"></rect>
      <text
        x="28"
        y="28"
        fill="#64748B"
        font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif"
        font-size="10"
        font-weight="700"
        letter-spacing="2">DX STACK · 4 LAYERS · THIN WORKSTATION</text
      >

      <!-- L0 Dotfiles -->
      <g transform="translate(24 44)">
        <rect width="800" height="92" rx="14" fill="#0F172A" stroke="#22D3EE" stroke-opacity="0.45"></rect>
        <rect x="14" y="14" width="84" height="22" rx="11" fill="#0B1220" stroke="#22D3EE" stroke-opacity="0.35"></rect>
        <text
          x="56"
          y="29"
          text-anchor="middle"
          fill="#A5F3FC"
          font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif"
          font-size="10"
          font-weight="800">L0 DOTFILES</text
        >
        <text
          x="14"
          y="58"
          fill="#F8FAFC"
          font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif"
          font-size="15"
          font-weight="800">HorneroConfig</text
        >
        <text x="210" y="58" fill="#94A3B8" font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif" font-size="12"
          >Hyprland + Quickshell · smart-colors · 13+ rices · chezmoi home/</text
        >
        <text x="14" y="78" fill="#64748B" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="10"
          >dotfiles — desktop personalization · theme-intelligence · delivers ~/.config/hypr &amp; quickshell</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- L1 Machine Provisioning -->
      <g transform="translate(24 152)">
        <rect width="800" height="92" rx="14" fill="#111827" stroke="#A78BFA" stroke-opacity="0.48"></rect>
        <rect x="14" y="14" width="166" height="22" rx="11" fill="#1E1B4B" stroke="#A78BFA" stroke-opacity="0.35"
        ></rect>
        <text
          x="97"
          y="29"
          text-anchor="middle"
          fill="#EDE9FE"
          font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif"
          font-size="10"
          font-weight="800">L1 MACHINE PROVISIONING</text
        >
        <text
          x="14"
          y="58"
          fill="#F8FAFC"
          font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif"
          font-size="15"
          font-weight="800">Agentic Workstation</text
        >
        <text x="250" y="58" fill="#94A3B8" font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif" font-size="12"
          >chezmoi apply · packages · shell · dots-doctor · thin helpers</text
        >
        <text x="14" y="78" fill="#64748B" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="10"
          >thin — ships no embedded skills · keeps only dev-companion/runner · chezmoi init --apply</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- L1.5 LLM Policy -->
      <g transform="translate(24 260)">
        <rect width="800" height="92" rx="14" fill="#0F172A" stroke="#FACC15" stroke-opacity="0.40"></rect>
        <rect x="14" y="14" width="104" height="22" rx="11" fill="#1A1605" stroke="#FACC15" stroke-opacity="0.35"
        ></rect>
        <text
          x="66"
          y="29"
          text-anchor="middle"
          fill="#FEF08A"
          font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif"
          font-size="10"
          font-weight="800">L1 LLM POLICY</text
        >
        <text
          x="14"
          y="58"
          fill="#F8FAFC"
          font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif"
          font-size="15"
          font-weight="800">LLM Policy</text
        >
        <text x="160" y="58" fill="#94A3B8" font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif" font-size="12"
          >env.d · provider allowlist · DOTS_AI_DEVCOMPANION_LLM_STRICT</text
        >
        <text x="14" y="78" fill="#64748B" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="10"
          >~/.config/agentic-workstation/env.d/*.env · never committed · dots-devcompanion llm-status</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- L1.5 Tooling -->
      <g transform="translate(24 368)">
        <rect width="800" height="92" rx="14" fill="#0F1A12" stroke="#84CC16" stroke-opacity="0.45"></rect>
        <rect x="14" y="14" width="92" height="22" rx="11" fill="#1A2E05" stroke="#84CC16" stroke-opacity="0.35"></rect>
        <text
          x="60"
          y="29"
          text-anchor="middle"
          fill="#ECFCCB"
          font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif"
          font-size="10"
          font-weight="800">L1.5 TOOLING</text
        >
        <text
          x="14"
          y="58"
          fill="#F8FAFC"
          font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif"
          font-size="15"
          font-weight="800">Agent Toolkit</text
        >
        <text x="200" y="58" fill="#94A3B8" font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif" font-size="12"
          >52 skills · 16 agents · 10 loops · 6 MCP · profiles · SKILL.md catalog</text
        >
        <text x="14" y="78" fill="#64748B" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace" font-size="10"
          >sole source via uv tool install --force agent-toolkit-cli &amp;&amp; agent-toolkit install</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Connector line -->
      <line
        x1="430"
        y1="136"
        x2="430"
        y2="152"
        stroke="url(#ws-stack-accent)"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-dasharray="6 4"
        opacity="0.7"></line>
      <line
        x1="430"
        y1="244"
        x2="430"
        y2="260"
        stroke="url(#ws-stack-accent)"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-dasharray="6 4"
        opacity="0.7"></line>
      <line
        x1="430"
        y1="352"
        x2="430"
        y2="368"
        stroke="url(#ws-stack-accent)"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-dasharray="6 4"
        opacity="0.7"></line>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <text x="28" y="500" fill="#475569" font-family="Inter, ui-sans-serif, sans-serif" font-size="10"
        >Identity · midnight #020617 · cyan #22D3EE · violet #A78BFA · lime #84CC16 · thin after L1</text
      >
    </svg>
    <figcaption class="ws-stack__caption">
      Four-layer stack: <strong>dotfiles</strong> (HorneroConfig) → <strong>machine provisioning</strong> (chezmoi) →
      <strong>LLM policy</strong> (env.d allowlist) → <strong>tooling</strong> (agent-toolkit). Harness runtime overlays all
      four. Thin boundary after L1 — no embedded capabilities in workstation.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>

  <!-- Fallback list for no-CSS / SR linearization -->
  <ul class="ws-stack__fallback" aria-hidden="false">
    <li><strong>Layer 0 — dotfiles:</strong> HorneroConfig · Hyprland + Quickshell · chezmoi home/</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Layer 1 — machine provisioning:</strong> agentic-workstation · chezmoi apply · packages · shell · thin
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Layer 1 — LLM policy:</strong> env.d · provider allowlist · DOTS_AI_DEVCOMPANION_LLM_STRICT · dots-devcompanion
      llm-status
    </li>
    <li><strong>Layer 1.5 — tooling:</strong> agent-toolkit · 52 skills · 16 agents · uv install</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .ws-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .ws-stack__head {
    max-width: 72ch;
  }
  .ws-stack__title {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.65rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-ink, #181512);
  }
  .ws-stack__lead {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted, #6b715e);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
  }
  .ws-stack__lead strong {
    color: var(--color-ink, #181512);
  }
  .ws-stack__figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ws-stack__svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e9d8c3);
    background: #020617;
  }
  .ws-stack__caption {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ws-stack__caption strong {
    color: #94a3b8;
  }
  .ws-stack__fallback {
    position: absolute;
    left: -10000px;
    top: auto;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ws-stack__svg * {
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
